      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/st-florian/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Florian Pharmacy stands as a modern landmark, reflecting the town’s blend of historic charm and contemporary life.",
